  Placement: 0
  CardStory: "The second execution comes without warning, but somehow 2Spade is not
    surprised. 2Club carries a pocket mirror. *Not allowed. That rule was changed.*
    The third one follows soon after. Then the fourth, and they don\u2019t stop.\r\n\r\nThe
    whole complex is full of the scent of cooking oil repurposed for killing. He
    has heard before that human flesh smells like cooked pork, but to experience
    it first hand is sickening. *My stomach growls when the fire sears her and the
    screams die down.* 2Spade retches, guts clenching at the sensation. *Don\u2019t
    I like 2Club?*\r\n\r\n2Spade does. Did. She is no more. He must get out of here.
    His days go on in a haze, and 2Spade can\u2019t tell where his own thoughts end
    and the smoke begins. He is thankful, when night comes and sleep takes him."
